#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:205
msgid "From YAML"
msgstr "从 YAML 构建"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:216
msgid ""
"**The class docstring's usage example does not work.** "
"`ProcessingPipeline`'s docstring shows "
"`client.pipeline.from_yaml(\"ndvi_workflow.yaml\").run()`. `from_yaml` is a "
"classmethod on `ProcessingPipeline`, while `client.pipeline` is a method, so"
" that call raises `AttributeError: 'function' object has no attribute "
"'from_yaml'`. Use `ProcessingPipeline.from_yaml(path, engine=client)`, as "
"shown above."
msgstr ""
"**类文档字符串中的用法示例无法运行。** `ProcessingPipeline` 的文档字符串给出了 "
"`client.pipeline.from_yaml(\"ndvi_workflow.yaml\").run()`。`from_yaml` 是 "
"`ProcessingPipeline` 上的类方法，而 `client.pipeline` 是一个方法，因此该调用会抛出 "
"`AttributeError: 'function' object has no attribute 'from_yaml'`。请按上文所示使用 "
"`ProcessingPipeline.from_yaml(path, engine=client)`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:224
msgid ""
"This YAML format (a chain of processing steps for one file) is **not the "
"same YAML format** as the acquisition-pipeline YAML at the top of this page "
"(`search`/`filter`/`download`/`process`/`export` for a recurring cron job). "
"Don't mix the two — a `weekly-sentinel2.yaml`-style file passed to "
"`ProcessingPipeline.from_yaml()` won't produce the steps you expect, and "
"vice versa."
msgstr ""
"这种 YAML 格式（针对单个文件的一串处理步骤）与本页开头的数据获取流水线 YAML（用于周期性 cron 任务的 "
"`search`/`filter`/`download`/`process`/`export`）**不是同一种 YAML 格式**。不要混用——把 "
"`weekly-sentinel2.yaml` 这类文件传给 `ProcessingPipeline.from_yaml()` "
"不会产生你预期的步骤，反之亦然。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:234
msgid "Batch Processing — `client.batch`"
msgstr "批处理——`client.batch`"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:236
msgid ""
"For \"run the same processing chain over many files, in parallel\" — simpler"
" than either pipeline concept above when there's no need for scheduling or "
"acquisition steps, just parallel fan-out over a file list."
msgstr "适用于“对许多文件并行运行同一条处理链”——当不需要调度或数据获取步骤、只需对文件列表并行扇出时，它比上文任何一种流水线概念都更简单。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:254
msgid ""
"`chain` is an ordered list of `(step_type, kwargs)` tuples — the same step "
"names as the fluent pipeline builder above, applied to every input file "
"independently (not chained *between* files, chained *within* each file). "
"`on_error` (via `client.batch.process(..., on_error=\"skip\")`, not exposed "
"on the `client.batch_process(...)` shortcut) controls whether one failing "
"file aborts the whole batch or is skipped so the rest still complete — "
"default `\"skip\"`."
msgstr ""
"`chain` 是由 `(step_type, kwargs)` "
"元组组成的有序列表——步骤名称与上文可链式流水线构建器相同，并独立地应用到每个输入文件上（不是在文件*之间*串联，而是在每个文件*内部*串联）。`on_error`（通过"
" `client.batch.process(..., on_error=\"skip\")` "
"传入，`client.batch_process(...)` "
"快捷方式不提供该参数）控制某个文件失败时是中止整个批处理，还是跳过它以便其余文件仍能完成——默认为 `\"skip\"`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:262
msgid "Arbitrary custom functions"
msgstr "任意自定义函数"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/workflows/pipelines.md:272
msgid ""
"`apply()` runs any function of your own — `(input_path, output_dir, "
"**kwargs) -> result` — across a file list in parallel, for processing steps "
"that don't already exist as a named pipeline step."
msgstr ""
"`apply()` 可对文件列表并行运行你自己编写的任何函数——`(input_path, output_dir, **kwargs) -> "
"result`——适用于尚无对应具名流水线步骤的处理操作。"
